    "detailed_description": "<h1>New Tower Defense!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301160/extras/51c8c56ec91e0c4c9b6e384145e02478.avif?t=1746379553\" width=600 height=220 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goblin Assault is an epic tower defense adventure where you stand against relentless hordes of goblins, monsters, and powerful bosses. Forge your strategy and prepare for a legendary fight!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301160/extras/2b572a33639ab65d4ef0bb8c38e79e50.webp?t=1746379553\" width=616 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301160/extras/40cf5a0d9927e6ae13570076744a1a08.poster.avif?t=1746379553\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301160/extras/40cf5a0d9927e6ae13570076744a1a08.webm?t=1746379553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301160/extras/40cf5a0d9927e6ae13570076744a1a08.mp4?t=1746379553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Goblin Assault</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblin Assault is an epic tower defense game where you defend against waves of goblins, fierce creatures, and mighty bosses determined to crush your defenses. Command a powerful lineup of allied units, unleash devastating spells, and upgrade your towers to hold the line. Each wave brings new challenges, demanding quick thinking and sharp strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301160/extras/434677872edc1823788bb13a948b0373.webp?t=1746379553\" width=616 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301160/extras/bdaf2be7395e305861af2a6e27d4b72d.poster.avif?t=1746379553\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301160/extras/bdaf2be7395e305861af2a6e27d4b72d.webm?t=1746379553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301160/extras/bdaf2be7395e305861af2a6e27d4b72d.mp4?t=1746379553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, unlock new upgrades, face off against even deadlier enemies, and conquer replayable levels filled with intense action. Prepare your defenses, rally your forces, and rise to become the ultimate commander in this thrilling battle for survival!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goblin Assault is an epic tower defense adventure where you stand against relentless hordes of goblins, monsters, and powerful bosses. Forge your strategy and prepare for a legendary fight!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301160/extras/2b572a33639ab65d4ef0bb8c38e79e50.webp?t=1746379553\" width=616 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301160/extras/40cf5a0d9927e6ae13570076744a1a08.poster.avif?t=1746379553\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301160/extras/40cf5a0d9927e6ae13570076744a1a08.webm?t=1746379553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301160/extras/40cf5a0d9927e6ae13570076744a1a08.mp4?t=1746379553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Goblin Assault</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblin Assault is an epic tower defense game where you defend against waves of goblins, fierce creatures, and mighty bosses determined to crush your defenses. Command a powerful lineup of allied units, unleash devastating spells, and upgrade your towers to hold the line. Each wave brings new challenges, demanding quick thinking and sharp strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301160/extras/434677872edc1823788bb13a948b0373.webp?t=1746379553\" width=616 height=49 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop pla